re greed  joke the super league clubs want to  start as soon as possible  but the premier league la liga and syria  are have all joined uefa in condemning  the move  so too have many fans competing clubs  face being booted out of their domestic  leagues  several television broadcasters are also  refusing to abandon uefa  and national leagues to join the new  project  but if it does go ahead football's  single sporting pyramid  from the lowest grassroots teams all the  way to the top  may never be the same again neve barker  al jazeera
 

